1
00:01:51,111 --> 00:01:54,491
Now I see.

2
00:01:54,731 --> 00:01:56,591
What's up, Robin? Did you find something?

3
00:01:57,591 --> 00:02:00,411
I just determined the culprit that stole your memories.

4
00:02:01,011 --> 00:02:03,651
Consequently, it's not the one we thought it was.

5
00:02:03,931 --> 00:02:06,291
Wait a second. You mean it's not that little brat?

6
00:02:06,771 --> 00:02:09,551
Now, let's make our way to the Sea God's Palace.

7
00:02:10,931 --> 00:02:12,371
Sea God's Palace?

8
00:02:12,911 --> 00:02:14,691
Okay, but why?

9
00:02:16,071 --> 00:02:17,311
Just a hunch.

10
00:02:21,951 --> 00:02:25,871
Zoro bears his fangs. A savage animal stands in the way.

11
00:02:30,371 --> 00:02:32,811
So that little brat's hideout is just up ahead?

12
00:02:33,091 --> 00:02:33,651
That's right.

13
00:02:33,931 --> 00:02:36,131
Come on, who's the real thief here, Robin?

14
00:02:37,011 --> 00:02:40,311
Isn't it about time you told us about whoever's behind all this?

15
00:02:40,551 --> 00:02:43,711
Everything will become clear once we reach the Sea God's Palace.

16
00:02:43,711 --> 00:02:51,591
They're up to something.

17
00:02:52,131 --> 00:02:56,611
They're going to take me deep into the jungle, lock me up, and then steal my gold.

18
00:02:57,691 --> 00:02:58,771
Oh, no!

19
00:02:59,331 --> 00:03:01,311
Is this place really his hideout?

20
00:03:02,691 --> 00:03:04,551
Seems pretty peaceful to me.

21
00:03:04,551 --> 00:03:09,071
That's what he wants you to think.

22
00:03:09,331 --> 00:03:10,711
Don't let your guard down.

23
00:03:12,411 --> 00:03:17,231
I bet he has an army of crazy monsters hiding around here, just waiting for the chance to pounce on us.

24
00:03:17,631 --> 00:03:19,091
What? Crazy monsters?

25
00:03:19,471 --> 00:03:23,311
Yeah, monsters are known to disguise themselves to look like their surroundings, and then...

26
00:03:23,311 --> 00:03:26,511
They sneak up, attack you, and gobble you whole.

27
00:03:26,891 --> 00:03:27,851
That's right. See?

28
00:03:27,851 --> 00:03:32,271
When you sail across the seas as many times as I have, you run into plenty of monsters.

29
00:03:32,431 --> 00:03:34,371
You become aware of where they're likely to be.

30
00:03:35,271 --> 00:03:36,731
