169
00:11:59,351 --> 00:12:01,191
It's about time you realized it.

170
00:12:01,191 --> 00:12:05,551
Leave now and come with me.

171
00:12:05,731 --> 00:12:08,971
If you do, I promise to take you anywhere in the world you want to go.

172
00:12:11,171 --> 00:12:14,471
You guys want to go back home to all of your family and friends, don't you?

173
00:12:14,491 --> 00:12:15,371
I know you do.

174
00:12:15,371 --> 00:12:22,011
I feel the exact same way.

175
00:12:22,791 --> 00:12:24,991
There's somewhere that I have to return to.

176
00:12:24,991 --> 00:12:30,831
Now that I think about it, I have no idea where these guys plan on taking me.

177
00:12:31,311 --> 00:12:34,531
It might be safer if I travel with her instead of these freaks of nature.

178
00:12:34,531 --> 00:12:41,211
You're right.

179
00:12:41,311 --> 00:12:42,431
It's the same for me.

180
00:12:43,031 --> 00:12:43,291
See?

181
00:12:43,431 --> 00:12:43,591
See?

182
00:12:43,711 --> 00:12:43,951
See?

183
00:12:44,311 --> 00:12:45,991
Then what's there to think about?

184
00:12:46,131 --> 00:12:47,271
Come on, let's go!

185
00:12:47,271 --> 00:12:53,211
I really can't blame you for not putting your trust in me since you've lost your memory.

186
00:12:54,031 --> 00:12:57,331
But whether you believe me or not, I ask that you follow me.

187
00:12:57,771 --> 00:12:58,151
Aha!

188
00:12:58,331 --> 00:12:59,151
What did I tell you?

189
00:12:59,231 --> 00:13:00,211
Did you hear what she said?

190
00:13:00,251 --> 00:13:01,391
She's lying to us!

191
00:13:02,531 --> 00:13:02,971
Listen.

192
00:13:03,551 --> 00:13:06,611
We all have dreams we want to fulfill on this sea.

193
00:13:07,631 --> 00:13:08,791
Don't be so stupid!

194
00:13:09,091 --> 00:13:13,351
People can't live just sailing around the world chasing their dreams and doing whatever the hell they want.

195
00:13:13,351 --> 00:13:14,611
Come on, give me a break!

196
00:13:14,911 --> 00:13:15,271
Maybe.

197
00:13:16,091 --> 00:13:18,251
But tell me something.

198
00:13:18,551 --> 00:13:20,891
What could be more important than chasing your dream?

199
00:13:24,031 --> 00:13:25,771
Let's chase our dreams together.

200
00:13:26,411 --> 00:13:28,531
Nothing in the world is more fun than that.

201
00:13:29,291 --> 00:13:32,291
