Come on, let's all go back to our homes.

205
00:13:45,991 --> 00:13:46,671
What do you say?

206
00:13:46,991 --> 00:13:47,471
I'm...

207
00:13:47,471 --> 00:13:49,591
I'm staying here with Luffy.

208
00:13:49,811 --> 00:13:50,511
