209
00:13:50,751 --> 00:13:52,571
Because Luffy called me his...

210
00:13:52,571 --> 00:13:55,851
He called me his friend and accepted me just the way I am.

211
00:13:56,391 --> 00:14:00,231
The exact same way that Dr. Heroic and Dr. Ian did before.

212
00:14:01,231 --> 00:14:06,151
Either way, be it go back home or chase my dream, there's something I need to take care of.

213
00:14:06,791 --> 00:14:10,491
I'm not gonna be satisfied until I catch that brat and teach him a lesson.

214
00:14:10,851 --> 00:14:12,111
That's happening first.

215
00:14:12,111 --> 00:14:17,811
I don't believe this.

216
00:14:18,351 --> 00:14:21,331
And with that matter being settled, I'm going on ahead.

217
