All right, you two, shall we?

218
00:14:24,391 --> 00:14:31,611
Aw, Tim at all.

219
00:14:31,811 --> 00:14:33,771
There's no point in going home without my memory.

220
00:14:33,991 --> 00:14:35,931
I've got to find some way to get it back.

221
00:14:36,931 --> 00:14:37,371
