275
00:19:23,171 --> 00:19:26,211
Ripple-boop-boop-boop-boop-boop-boop-boop-boop-boop!

276
00:19:26,271 --> 00:19:31,571
You ignorant jerk, I'm not an octopus, I'm a seahorse, got it? That's what he said, not me.

277
00:19:31,891 --> 00:19:34,171
It doesn't matter what you are, you little thief!

278
00:19:40,471 --> 00:19:41,331
Hey! It's you!

279
00:19:41,571 --> 00:19:43,171
Hey! It's you!

280
00:19:47,171 --> 00:19:50,611
Hurry up and cough up the rest of our memories or I'll fry you!

281
00:19:50,611 --> 00:19:59,811
What the? What happened?

282
00:20:00,051 --> 00:20:01,611
