292
00:20:28,051 --> 00:20:29,051
But...

293
00:20:30,251 --> 00:20:32,351
we don't know if that moss-headed swordsman

294
00:20:32,351 --> 00:20:34,431
got his memories back or not.

295
00:20:34,431 --> 00:20:35,431
Yeah, you're right.

296
00:20:35,431 --> 00:20:37,931
If he didn't, then what are we gonna do?

297
00:20:41,531 --> 00:20:42,431
Zoro!

298
00:20:45,851 --> 00:20:47,191
Where's Luffy?

299
00:20:47,191 --> 00:20:49,031
Wait, you don't...

300
00:20:49,031 --> 00:20:51,071
You don't think that Zoro killed him, do you?

301
00:20:55,291 --> 00:20:55,791
No...

302
00:20:55,791 --> 00:20:57,291
It can't be!

303
00:21:03,291 --> 00:21:04,791
What happened to the captain?

304
00:21:04,791 --> 00:21:05,791
What happened to the captain?

305
00:21:13,431 --> 00:21:14,351
Now listen up!

306
00:21:15,251 --> 00:21:17,231
If you plan on hurting these ladies,

307
00:21:17,231 --> 00:21:19,551
then you're gonna have to go through me to do it!

308
00:21:27,551 --> 00:21:28,551
Bim-pah!

309
00:21:28,551 --> 00:21:29,551
Bim-pah!

310
00:21:29,551 --> 00:21:33,551
He said I still haven't played my trump card yet!

311
00:21:33,551 --> 00:21:34,051
Yeah!

312
00:21:46,311 --> 00:21:48,311
掴み掛けた夢の欠片

313
00:21:48,311 --> 00:21:49,751
変わらないもの

314
00:21:49,751 --> 00:21:51,811
掘ってる僕らは

315
00:21:51,811 --> 00:21:54,811
憧れを空に浮かべて

316
00:21:54,811 --> 00:21:55,451
eh- nah-

317
00:21:55,451 --> 00:21:55,891
Answering me,

318
00:21:55,891 --> 00:21:57,511
e-

319
00:21:57,511 --> 00:21:58,071
Hallo!

320
00:21:58,071 --> 00:21:59,071
bodyguard

321
00:22:15,151 --> 00:22:15,651
dh-

322
00:23:06,151 --> 00:23:11,151
The last counter attack by the memory thief who revealed his true colors.

323
00:23:11,151 --> 00:23:13,151
I'm gonna be king of the pirates!

